     "description": "‘Murder She Wrote’ is Brooke Evers first single since 2019’s ‘Get Dirty’ before taking a motherhood hiatus, rising to bring us a fresh take on the early-’90s dancehall classic by Jamaican duo Chaka Demus & Pliers, originally produced by the legendary Sly & Robbie. Brooke carries the track from Kingston to the house floor, keeping the original’s bounce and dropping a driving four-on-the-floor groove underneath to give us the chance to revel in the record during peak-time moments.",
